_publ_section_synopsis
;
The structure of
bis(<i>N</i>,<i>N</i>-diethyl-4-methyl-4-piperazine-1-carboxamide)
tetrakis(isothiocyanto)cobalt(II) [or bis(carbamazide)
tetrakis(isothiocyanato)cobalt(II)] is reported. This complex represents an
example of the compound found in the colormetric response in Scott's test.
;
